# Test tools for CI (lint-test, Molecule, release build); compiled into requirements-test.txt with
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras requirements-test.in
# (pip-tools 7.6.2) under Python 3.12 on Ubuntu 24.04, the Python of the GitHub ubuntu-24.04
# runner. Install with
#   pip install --require-hashes --only-binary=:all: -r requirements-test.txt
# The "ansible" package brings the community collections that the Molecule docker driver and
# the roles use (community.docker, ansible.posix, ...), pinned and hashed with it.
-c requirements-dev.txt
